  Problem Analysis                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
  Error: "Failed to enter shop: can only enter shop after combat is over"                                                                                                                                                                                                         
  When: Clicking "Continue to Shop" after combat ends naturally (not via "Win Match")                                                                                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
  Root Cause                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
  State synchronization mismatch between:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
  1. Socket assigns (LiveView client state) - Updated after each combat action                                                                                                                                                                                                    
  2. GenServer state (Game server state) - Only updated by "Win Match" button                                                                                                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
  When combat ended through gameplay (check_game_over set combat.state to :game_over):                                                                                                                                                                                            
  - ✅ Socket assigns updated with :game_over state                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
  - ❌ GenServer state remained at :running                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
  When Game.enter_shop/1 was called:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
  - It checks GenServer state (not socket assigns)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
  - Found combat.state == :running instead of :game_over                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
  - Returned error: "Can only enter shop after combat is over"                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
  Solution                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
  Added sync_game_state_if_needed/2 helper in campaign_play_live.ex:395-400 that automatically syncs GenServer state when combat ends:                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
  defp sync_game_state_if_needed(game_pid, game_state) do                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
    if game_pid && game_state.combat.state == :game_over do                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
      :ok = GenServer.call(game_pid, {:set_state, game_state})                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
    end                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
  end                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
  This helper is called after every combat action in:                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
  - handle_event("pick_card", ...) - Line 119                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
  - handle_event("interact", ...) for play_card - Line 141                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
  - handle_event("interact", ...) for move - Line 174                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
  - handle_event("skip_turn", ...) - Line 206                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
  Now when combat ends naturally, both socket and GenServer states stay synchronized!                                                                                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
  Files Modified                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
  lib/game_web/live/campaign/campaign_play_live.ex:                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
  - Added sync_game_state_if_needed/2 private helper function                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
  - Updated 4 event handlers to call the sync function after processing combat actions                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
  The fix is succinct (6 lines of helper code + 4 function calls) and ensures shop navigation works correctly whether combat ends through gameplay or the "Win Match" button.     